CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --apply-loop-contracts
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^\[main\.assigns\.\d+\] line \d+ Check that t is assignable: FAILURE$
--
--
Checks that a variable whose address outlives the loop (through `p`) is not a
loop local, since it may be read after the loop.
